.TH commit 1  "commit " 
.SH NAME
commit \- Publish the current draft Change
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcommit\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Publish the current draft Change
.PP
Commits all staged operations in open draft transaction into a single ChangeRevision and publishes to accepted state.
.PP
Machine JSON supported: \-\-json flag.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "EVERYDAY WORKFLOW"
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
